   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MEP301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 6 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14489 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MEP301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>6 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14489 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Explain the five main stages of a multimedia project, the intangible factors affecting production quality, the key team roles with their required skills, and the common hardware/software tools used. Includes guidance on selecting suitable platforms for effective multimedia production.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Analyze and determine the scope, objectives, target audience, creative strategy, and budget of a multimedia project, examine the intangible elements needed to make good multimedia production</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Develop a complete project plan with clear phases, tasks, schedules, resource allocation, and a well-defined project scope. Evaluate project requirements such as cost, timeline, workload, and risks necessary for completing a multimedia project.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Apply multimedia production tools and AI-based tools to optimize workflows and enhance project efficiency.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Evaluate overall quality of the project, delivers the intended message or experience, and fulfills user needs within the defined scope and constraints.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Have accountability, good self-organization, and strong collaborative skills while working with the team on the multimedia project. Contribute actively and communicates effectively to support overall project success.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14489\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14489</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14489\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14489</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
